      "message": "I shouldn\u0027t have called out Microdroid specifically - I just assume different hypervisors might lead to different levels of overhead.\n\nI think careful monitoring is going to be necessary anyway - if the vendor sets it to 10, but they should have set it to 20, then problems could arise, just as if they were to erroneously set it to -10.\n\nI think we\u0027ll need to make it clear they need to be very careful.",
